# Contexte de build : la racine du monorepo. Seuls les manifestes du workspace et apps/api entrent.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!.npmrc
!apps/api

**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
apps/api/dist
apps/api/coverage
apps/api/test
apps/api/**/*.spec.ts
apps/api/compose.yaml
apps/api/scripts
apps/api/.env
apps/api/.env.*
apps/api/docs
apps/api/**/*.md
apps/api/**/*.log
apps/api/.claude
apps/api/ci
